        "Title": "Hack the Hackers",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COLORADO",
        "PublicId": "109980922769",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Colorado_2/_scene_bull.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 36896e6d-cdb0-4cba-808d-74c3f564cd09).Image",
        "Description": "Agent 47 was recently scammed online by a group of low-life hackers. He managed to track them down to Colorado. They took a bunch of money from Agent 47 when he simply thought he&apos;d met the girl of his life at long last. She had a sick mother - or so Agent 47 thought - and &quot;she&quot; needed help paying her mother&apos;s bills. It cost our beloved assassin a lot of his hard earned money. Let&apos;s end this network! Quickly they rose to power, only to now fall to their doom.",
